細項時。烏龍麵要再加錢，不然你只能吃意麵，明顯是故意這樣設計的\n\n3.麵裡面一堆便宜火鍋料，那跟路邊的鍋燒意麵有什麼差別？（即使一碗要三百）\n\n4.室內已經很熱了，還吃熱燙麵，結果飲料機是空的\n\n5.椅子真的很不好坐，全都是硬椅子\n\n最後來講點好的，就是湯頭不錯喝，沒了",null,[0,55]]]],[null,1728438838000000,1728438838000000,"1 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQm04enVMVWhFQUJuQmVJMkFBdnhlZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQm04enVMVWhFQUJuQmVJMkFBdnhlZxoTQ2d3SXRzU1h1QVlRLTlENDdRSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjMn-W4x9KWAxX7kq8BHTiSMjEQ_2MIlgEoCA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11572972494873120872/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnliWFEzU0VWUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11572972494873120872/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnliWFEzU0VWUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11572972494873120872/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnliWFEzU0VWUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11572972494873120872/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnliWFEzU0VWUkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11572972494873120872/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnliWFEzU0VWUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11572972494873120872/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnliWFEzU0VWUkVBRRAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["非常抱歉讓您有不滿意的用餐體驗，我們會立即檢討並改進，力求為顧客提供更好的服務和美食。我們希望未來有機會為您重新提供值得推薦的中和外送美食和中和午晚餐必吃推薦。非常感謝您的反饋，我們會繼續努力提升，讓每一位顧客都能享受到優質的烏龍麵和丼飯。希望您能再給我們一次機會，讓我們成為您心中喜愛的中和平價美食選擇。",null,[0,153]]]],[null,null,4937,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNybXQ3SEVREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x6c97363d9fea837!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICrmt7HEQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNybXQ3SEVREAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNybXQ3SEVREi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ3JtdDdIa1FFEhNDZ3